	(text "PROOF OF CONCEPT\n* Regulated 5V from 12V\n* Vref 2.5V from 5V\n* Analog Output control via DAC 0V to +9.9V\n* Dual analog outputs with synchronous latching\n* Communication to DAC chip via SPI\n  - Master design low on GPIO so use SPI MISO for latch\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
